=== string hl_arm
Arm

=== string hl_arms
Arms

=== string hl_arms_desc
This protects the character's arms from being damaged by weapons or spells.  If either arm's health reaches 0, the character's attacks and spellcasting will be significantly slower.

=== string hl_leg
Leg

=== string hl_legs
Legs

=== string hl_legs_desc
This protects the character's legs from being damaged by weapons or spells. If any leg's health reaches 0, the character will move much slower.

=== string hl_skull
Head

=== string hl_skull_desc
This protects the character's head from being damaged by weapons or spells. If the head's health reaches 0, the character will die.

=== string hl_torso
Body

=== string hl_torso_desc
This protects the character's body from being damaged by weapons or spells. If the body's health reaches 0, the character will die.

